    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Monster Slayers Incorporated, you play as the manager of a monster-hunting guild. Max out your KPIs in your insatiable quest for the highest quarterly returns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Build your team -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire heroes from a range of different class options, each with its own equippable weapon types and promotion trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/5356d95983cad92fe6645dac935c9e7e.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/5356d95983cad92fe6645dac935c9e7e.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/5356d95983cad92fe6645dac935c9e7e.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Embark on Quests -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign quest contracts and navigate parties of heroes through monster-infested territories. Pick up treasure and encounter special events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/476a8dbb93bb18bccee1723349e4913d.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/476a8dbb93bb18bccee1723349e4913d.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/476a8dbb93bb18bccee1723349e4913d.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/7fb8a659b7cc6c29963292cc3b624db1.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/7fb8a659b7cc6c29963292cc3b624db1.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/7fb8a659b7cc6c29963292cc3b624db1.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Slay Monsters -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring unique combat that combines elements of autobattlers and tactical RPGs. Position your heroes according to different weapon attack patterns. Use items or modify equipment between rounds to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/76f496badd277a8c57679ff0b07845f4.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/76f496badd277a8c57679ff0b07845f4.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/76f496badd277a8c57679ff0b07845f4.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/a3c871416eddf0c42c4e3710276fb058.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/a3c871416eddf0c42c4e3710276fb058.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/a3c871416eddf0c42c4e3710276fb058.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monster types in each location introduce new strategies and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Expand your Guild -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between quests, take on research projects to unlock new hero classes and items. Build new facilities or upgrade existing ones to give your teams the best employee benefits that gold can buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/cf5fbf61b57b10d31ce609b15a61a0bb.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/cf5fbf61b57b10d31ce609b15a61a0bb.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Monster Slayers Incorporated, you play as the manager of a monster-hunting guild. Max out your KPIs in your insatiable quest for the highest quarterly returns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Build your team -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire heroes from a range of different class options, each with its own equippable weapon types and promotion trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/5356d95983cad92fe6645dac935c9e7e.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/5356d95983cad92fe6645dac935c9e7e.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/5356d95983cad92fe6645dac935c9e7e.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Embark on Quests -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign quest contracts and navigate parties of heroes through monster-infested territories. Pick up treasure and encounter special events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/476a8dbb93bb18bccee1723349e4913d.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/476a8dbb93bb18bccee1723349e4913d.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/476a8dbb93bb18bccee1723349e4913d.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/7fb8a659b7cc6c29963292cc3b624db1.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/7fb8a659b7cc6c29963292cc3b624db1.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/7fb8a659b7cc6c29963292cc3b624db1.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Slay Monsters -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring unique combat that combines elements of autobattlers and tactical RPGs. Position your heroes according to different weapon attack patterns. Use items or modify equipment between rounds to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/76f496badd277a8c57679ff0b07845f4.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/76f496badd277a8c57679ff0b07845f4.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/76f496badd277a8c57679ff0b07845f4.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/a3c871416eddf0c42c4e3710276fb058.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/a3c871416eddf0c42c4e3710276fb058.webm?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/a3c871416eddf0c42c4e3710276fb058.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monster types in each location introduce new strategies and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Expand your Guild -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between quests, take on research projects to unlock new hero classes and items. Build new facilities or upgrade existing ones to give your teams the best employee benefits that gold can buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/cf5fbf61b57b10d31ce609b15a61a0bb.poster.avif?t=1753213798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/cf5fbf61b57b10d31ce609b15a61a0bb.mp4?t=1753213798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
